WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.750
Open the geometry inside an image-registration review. Authored shapes. No tissue data.

2
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:07.500
Follow the declared source-to-target transform. x points right. y points down.

3
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.250
Inspect the polygon, excluded interior and separate regions. Depth is added for inspection; the source ROI is 2D.

4
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:15.000
Three asymmetric points connect the authored image pair. These points were authored, not fitted to research data.

5
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.750
A correct translation can move source support outside the target. Physical calibration is also not evaluated.

6
00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:22.500
The report binds the inputs. A separate decision controls export. No person’s approval is represented by this animation.

7
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.250
Images, annotations, policy and code belong to the same review. Input and engine bindings help detect stale decisions.

8
00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:30.000
Orbit the model. Separate the layers. Read the synthetic report. Researcher usefulness and external-viewer import are unconfirmed.
